  "body": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.tw93.fun/pic/cole.png\" alt=\"Mole Logo\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" style=\"border-radius:50%\" />\n  <h1 style=\"margin: 12px 0 6px;\">Mole</h1>\n  <p><em>Deep clean and optimize your Mac.</em></p>\n</div>\n\n### Changelog\n\n1. **Uninstall finishes again**: a slow login item or LaunchServices step no longer stops the run with only `Uninstalling X...` left on screen, and any real stop now names the app and the step.\n2. **Uninstall works on managed Macs**: when Mole cannot check for other copies of an app, it removes only the app you picked and leaves shared leftovers in place instead of refusing.\n3. **Installer cleanup is more careful**: an unreadable folder or ZIP no longer hides the readable installers, each file is checked again right before removal, and a timeout now shows what was removed and where it stopped.\n4. **Analyze shows what it could not measure**: folders it cannot fully read are marked partial or unknown instead of 0, and `mo analyze --json` reports this in `scan_status`.\n5. **Clean lists more large payloads for review**: Android emulators and system images, the Hugging Face cache, mise installs, and Gradle caches now show their size, and Mole never deletes them.\n6. **Status stops retrying too fast**: after a failed probe, the dashboard and `mo status --watch` wait before collecting again and keep the measurements that did succeed.\n\n### 更新日志\n\n1. **卸载能正常走完**：登录项或 LaunchServices 这类步骤变慢时，不再中途停下只剩 `Uninstalling X...`，真正停下时也会说明是哪个 app、哪一步。\n2. **企业管理的 Mac 也能卸载**：Mole 无法检查同一 app 的其他副本时，改为只删除你选中的 app，共享残留保持不动，不再直接拒绝。\n3. **安装包清理更稳妥**：某个文件夹或 ZIP 读不了时不再连带隐藏可读的安装包，删除前会再核对一次文件，超时时也会显示已删除的内容和停在哪个文件。\n4. **Analyze 会标出没能测完的部分**：读不全的文件夹显示为部分或未知，不再显示为 0，`mo analyze --json` 通过 `scan_status` 给出同样的信息。\n5. **Clean 提示更多大文件供你自行处理**：Android 模拟器和系统镜像、Hugging Face 缓存、mise 安装的运行时和 Gradle 缓存会显示体积，Mole 不会删除它们。\n6. **Status 不再频繁重试**：探测失败后，仪表盘和 `mo status --watch` 会等一段时间再采集，已经成功的数据也会保留。\n\n### Thanks\n\nIssue reporters and PR contributors this cycle: @M-Hassan-Raza · @candidosales · @ilypopv.\n\n### Mole Mac App\n\nPrefer a GUI? [Mole Mac App](https://mole.fit/) brings cleaning, app management, maintenance, disk analysis, and live system status into one native app, with review before deletion and a customizable menu bar HUD. It is $19 once, with free updates and a 14-day refund. [Download and try it](https://mole.fit/download). The CLI stays free and open source.\n",
